": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-quGML8eGcoQ7kNvwEmP8zr&_nc_oc=Adqsti8AFjrAT6PJ_kxrh1nKB6YmDwXjXHJ4fHNyCSHD00bAWWz4leS2HP9O6t7EwR8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGGbbgtbNBwNu08LH8DmDrXD74F7qoy4HENl9GUCsPSbg&oe=6A941CDB"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r5YmUBcwWl4Q7kNvwFJqxPk&_nc_oc=AdoF-DTTqRF8hdeJLZGNcibx-fal5Kg0lpWzLOs_5m9mrntCfpFlxPxH0kE1faIAQ-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHfH6cETdkZY7ZZY8GNOQM1XS7mghDfcc9N1tgZsO7arg&oe=6A940D21"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6COTKJTFosYQ7kNvwGxHdZM&_nc_oc=AdpuKpRgcabp8nclmGkrPCxjfSdUWGSbjkG5izIfAd2GS3BIQrOD9iY-iFsAeSmXZ1o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH43csVXwMBMKmH55GgZe9gQT2QOrXGaJ6_otEa7XClIQ&oe=6A94322F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wx4FGA3eVGcQ7kNvwFboYUQ&_nc_oc=Adp-vFh1oam3LfZK28abfiIGhUtiNAnXIO46U2empRylQTV1OwFzkb7F-dHakg35zFI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHpbRhmHwv7ke3IIW5u6HCVBXUvo82dTJfy8VMy0bQJNA&oe=6A9431D2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AJrbtWbkXC8Q7kNvwGKBi2I&_nc_oc=Adqzvtmgmm6CnuZIU_s1OIwOxOwNk6gcBxxbIM71ESwYLUBGcOTVJbHlcQ0twWg6xLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-qro1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG0eiM_h69Z7B5UGTr6Br-pWa1FC0z0T_VuWGQGndY7Sg&oe=6A94033D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a